      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "EXP-ARCH-004-C01",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "mainfunctions.ReplicateEntity按GUID取inst并调其ReplicateEntity；实体方法遍历已登记名称，以_或__construction tag决定构造replica，之后才调用该实体OnEntityReplicated。ReplicateComponent先构造cmp(self)，再rawset到底层表；public replica读取另经_<name>标签过滤。这里没有证明不同实体之间的引擎到达顺序。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "AR-S01",
            "AR-S02",
            "AR-S03"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-ARCH-004-C02",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "container_classified客户端安装OnEntityReplicated；回调从原生parent取得_parent，无parent只输出消息；有parent则TryAttachClassifiedToReplicaComponent。该helper直接取parent底层replica，存在便调用AttachClassified并true，不存在false；false分支把inst暂存在parent.container_classified，并安装清除该字段的OnRemoveEntity。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "AR-S09",
            "AR-S05",
            "AR-S02"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-ARCH-004-C03",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Container客户端构造先containers.widgetsetup(self)；该helper在有匹配配置时复制其字段并按widget.numslots或slotpos长度SetNumSlots。若self.classified仍nil而inst.container_classified存在，取走该引用、清classified.OnRemoveEntity、清inst.container_classified，再AttachClassified。由此构造后有replica的直接附着与构造时消费暂存字段形成两条补接路径；不是依赖固定一帧重试。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "AR-S04",
            "AR-S05",
            "AR-S06",
            "AR-S11",
            "AR-S12"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-ARCH-004-C04",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "Container:AttachClassified先写self.classified，建立onremove闭包并在classified上监听，然后以当前GetNumSlots调用classified.InitializeSlots；DetachClassified移除该监听并清两个字段。此方法没有先解绑旧classified或去重已有Attach。若后面的槽初始化抛错，前述字段及listener已写，未见本方法回滚。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "AR-S06",
            "AR-S07",
            "AR-S10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "EXP-ARCH-004-C05",
          "kind": "NSF",
          "statement": "container_classified构造把_slottasks置nil并准备items池，客户端另排DoStaticTaskInTime(0, RegisterNetListeners)。RegisterNetListeners先将_slottasks赋表，再刷新和装各item dirty监听；InitializeSlots第一步assert(_slottasks==nil)，之后仅在_items与_itemspool间移动条目。Container:WidgetSetup在classified存在时也会调用InitializeSlots，故listener登记后再次调用到该分支将触发断言；这不是任意时刻可重复的幂等初始化API。",
          "evidence_refs": [
            "AR-S09",
            "AR-S08",
            "AR-S07",
            "AR-S10"
          ]
        },
